              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cheri"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved the flavor! I marinated for several hours because it was convenient to put in the refrigerator early in the day. I browned the chicken and then baked in the oven at 350 for 30 minutes. I would prefer to mix more of the picante sauce and mustard to put a spoon full on the top of each piece of chicken before baking. Came out very tender and tasted great.",
