              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Vicki"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family loved this recipe! Just enought kick to taste great without it being too spicy (I used a mild salsa as we don't like too much spice.)I also added some cilantro and it was great. Served it with Quinoa, which kept the feel very light, and a blend of fresh cooked brocholli and carrots for added color and texture.",
            "datePublished": "2009-01-25T12:05:25.330Z"
          },
