              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TRAILHR"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I like the simplicity of this recipe. I found it a bit bland but would punch up the flavour next time with dried peppers and a bit more Dijon. Thickening the sauce before the final step would help it to adhere to the chicken.",
