              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dannica"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was great! I served it with 4 cheese rice-a-roni. My son and husband loved it. I think next time I will add more picante and a little less mustard. I was pleasantly surprised by the flavor.. I will absolutely make this again",
