              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Janelle B."
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a perfect marinade, using things I had on hond. We marinated for 30-45 minutes, then grilled 3 large chicken breasts. I had to add a bit more of the picante and the mustard to have enough, but the chicken was GREAT! And it went great with the ranch dressing I dipped it in.",
