              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "chibiharuka"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Pretty good any day of the week meal. Guess the flavor depends on your picante sauce of choice. I did get an early start &amp; marinated the chicken about 1.5 hrs. Didn't like the idea of using the marinade as a sauce, so I skipped that part. Nice flavor, don't overcook the chicken.",
