              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "STORMYSHORES"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I really liked this. I used only 4 chicken breasts and there was just enough sauce, so if I had used six I would have upped the sauce ingredients a bit. Next time I'm going to use less lemon juice, it had a bit of a bite and I wanted more of the picante flavor. I served with Mexican rice and a side of green beans and it was a great meal-- and quick, too...",
